anges/archive/2026-11-03-build-notes-archive/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fixed factories (core, codeBlock, blocks, slash, bubble, handle, media, preview) stubbed by U3 so units fill their own file and never edit the composition."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_03_build_notes_archive_design_content_storage", "label": "ProseMirror JSON as source of truth", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-03-build-notes-archive/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "notes.content is JSON; body_text derived server-side on every write; sanitize.ts maps unknown nodes to paragraphs so older content renders."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_03_build_notes_archive_design_plaintext_walker", "label": "plainText hand-written JSON walker (plaintext.ts)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-03-build-notes-archive/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No DOM, no Tiptap on the server; invalid input yields ''."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_03_build_notes_archive_design_fts5_search", "label": "FTS5 notes_fts search (unicode61 remove_diacritics 2, bm25 10/1/5)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-03-build-notes-archive/design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tokens become quoted prefix terms so FTS syntax chars never reach the query; snippets split on char(2)/char(3) sentinels so no HTML from note text renders."}, {"id": "openspec_changes_archive_2026_11_03_build_notes_archive_design_foldsearch", "label": "foldSearch \u00df\u2192ss folding", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ope